                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Positive:\n\n+ Good music\n+ Colorful graphics\n+ Some levels are well designed\n\nNegative:\n\n- Story is weird\n- Unfair placement of \"special coins\" sometimes\n- Bad power ups, except the bee (and the turtle for world 3)\n- No attack except jumping on heads\n- You can't beat a fish?\n- Enemies look REALLY familiar\n- Bosses are way too easy with the bee upgrade\n- Sometimes your way is obscured by the fron layer\n- You can't continue your savegame after beating the last level to collect more coins\n\n\nEverytime i was beginning to enjoy the game, it threw another bummer at me. I feel like it has some wasted potential. Some things have changed since i last played it, so maybe i will give another shot some day.",
